{% endif %}## Install

```sh
mkdir -p ~/.config/aerc/stylesets
curl -fsSLo ~/.config/aerc/stylesets/acid-acetic \
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/acid-theme/aerc/main/acid-acetic
```

Then select it in `aerc.conf`:

```ini
[ui]
styleset-name=acid-acetic
```

